1
00:00:08,850 --> 00:00:11,277
Ab sabse zaroori kaam, billing.

2
00:00:11,317 --> 00:00:16,448
Billing screen keyboard se chalne ke liye bani
hai: F2 se search,

3
00:00:16,488 --> 00:00:21,700
Enter se item cart mein, F4 se bill hold, aur F9
se bill complete.

4
00:00:22,453 --> 00:00:26,254
F2 dabaaiye aur brand ka naam likhiye, jaise
Paracip.

5
00:00:26,294 --> 00:00:30,240
Enter dabaate hi pehli medicine cart mein aa
jaati hai.

6
00:00:31,020 --> 00:00:36,913
Salt se bhi khoj sakte hain: Cetirizine likhne
par usi salt ki medicine milti hai.

7
00:00:36,953 --> 00:00:41,326
Aur barcode scanner se scan kijiye; scanner
kitna bhi tez ho,

8
00:00:41,366 --> 00:00:45,016
wahi medicine cart mein aati hai jiska barcode
hai.

9
00:00:45,793 --> 00:00:52,027
Quantity plus-minus se badliye, aur strip ki
jagah loose tablet bhi chun sakte hain.

10
00:00:52,067 --> 00:00:58,973
Batch aapko nahi chunna padta: Medoro FEFO se
sabse pehle expire hone wala batch lagaata hai.

11
00:00:59,730 --> 00:01:04,781
Customer ka mobile number daalte hi purana
customer pehchaan liya jaata hai.

12
00:01:04,821 --> 00:01:10,206
Discount utna hi de sakte hain jitni role ko
anumati hai; yahan paanch pratishat.

13
00:01:10,982 --> 00:01:13,907
Tabhi doosra customer jaldi mein aata hai.

14
00:01:13,947 --> 00:01:17,649
F4 dabaaiye: yeh bill hold ho jaata hai, cart
khaali,

15
00:01:17,689 --> 00:01:21,673
aur neeche 'Held bills' mein yeh bill intezaar
karta hai.

16
00:01:22,429 --> 00:01:25,337
Doosre customer ka bill: Vitadem C.

17
00:01:25,377 --> 00:01:29,464
Woh aadha cash aur aadha UPI se dena chahte
hain.

18
00:01:29,504 --> 00:01:30,644
Split chuniye,

19
00:01:30,684 --> 00:01:37,635
cash hissa bees rupaye daaliye; baaki rakam UPI
ya card mein apne-aap aa jaati hai.

20
00:01:38,405 --> 00:01:39,405
F9 dabaaiye.

21
00:01:39,445 --> 00:01:44,864
Invoice par dono bhugtaan alag-alag chhapte
hain: cash aur UPI.

22
00:01:45,624 --> 00:01:50,875
Ab pehla bill waapas kholiye: 'Held bills' mein
Resume dabaaiye.

23
00:01:50,915 --> 00:01:55,587
Cart, customer aur discount, sab waise hi laut
aate hain.

24
00:01:55,627 --> 00:01:59,060
Yeh customer UPI se pay kar rahe hain; F9.

25
00:01:59,802 --> 00:02:06,803
Tax invoice par pharmacy ka GSTIN aur drug
licence, har item ka batch, expiry, HSN

26
00:02:06,843 --> 00:02:10,839
aur GST, aur neeche CGST aur SGST chhapte hain.

27
00:02:10,879 --> 00:02:14,188
MRP mein GST pehle se shaamil hota hai.

28
00:02:14,228 --> 00:02:21,057
Print se chhaapiye, ya browser ke print mein
'Save as PDF' chunkar PDF banaaiye.

29
00:02:21,823 --> 00:02:23,825
Aakhir mein card aur credit.

30
00:02:23,865 --> 00:02:26,377
Rakesh ji ke paas credit limit hai,

31
00:02:26,417 --> 00:02:32,210
isliye unke liye Credit option bhi dikhta hai;
rakam unke khaate mein jaati hai.

32
00:02:32,250 --> 00:02:34,689
Yeh bill hum card se le rahe hain.

33
00:02:42,280 --> 00:02:48,604
Schedule H aur H1 ki davaayein sirf registered
doctor ki prescription par bikti hain.

34
00:02:48,644 --> 00:02:52,197
Medoro yeh niyam billing par hi laagu karta hai.

35
00:02:52,237 --> 00:02:58,860
Search list mein aisi medicines ke saath laal
rang mein Sch H ya Sch H1 likha dikhta hai.

36
00:02:59,633 --> 00:03:02,326
Cefidem 200 ek Schedule H1 dava hai.

37
00:03:02,366 --> 00:03:06,578
Ise cart mein daalte hi Prescription section
khulta hai,

38
00:03:06,618 --> 00:03:09,919
aur likha aata hai: Required for Schedule H.

39
00:03:10,689 --> 00:03:16,889
Bina prescriber details ke bill poora karne ki
koshish karein, to Medoro bill nahi banata.

40
00:03:16,929 --> 00:03:19,107
Yeh check hataaya nahi ja sakta.

41
00:03:19,855 --> 00:03:26,297
Ab doctor ka naam, unka registration number, aur
H1 dava ke liye patient ka naam bhariye.

42
00:03:26,337 --> 00:03:30,158
Is demo mein doctor aur patient, dono kaalpanik
hain.

43
00:03:30,919 --> 00:03:31,313
Ab F9.

44
00:03:31,353 --> 00:03:37,828
Bill ban gaya, aur prescriber ka naam aur
registration number invoice par bhi chhapta hai.

45
00:03:38,593 --> 00:03:44,564
Doctors screen par aap prescribing doctors ka
record rakhte hain: naam, qualification,

46
00:03:44,604 --> 00:03:46,731
registration number aur clinic.

47
00:03:46,771 --> 00:03:51,974
'Sales by doctor' mein har doctor ki
prescriptions se hui bikri dikhti hai.

48
00:03:52,738 --> 00:03:57,457
Schedule H1 ka register 'Books & registers'
screen par hai.

49
00:03:57,497 --> 00:04:03,346
Ismein har H1 dava ki bikri darj hai: taareekh,
invoice, patient, doctor,

50
00:04:03,386 --> 00:04:07,541
registration number, dava, batch, expiry aur
maatra.

51
00:04:07,581 --> 00:04:13,107
Kisi line mein jaankari adhoori ho, to woh laal
rang mein dikhti hai.

52
00:04:13,879 --> 00:04:18,991
CSV button se poora register download kijiye, ya
Print se chhaapiye.

53
00:04:19,031 --> 00:04:23,082
Drug inspector ke maangne par yahi register
dikhaaiye.

54
00:04:23,122 --> 00:04:27,552
Medoro legal check ko bypass karne ka koi raasta
nahi deta.

55
00:04:33,600 --> 00:04:36,176
Customer dava waapas karne aaya hai.

56
00:04:36,216 --> 00:04:38,574
'Bills & day-end' screen kholiye.

57
00:04:38,614 --> 00:04:44,677
Yahan invoice number, customer ke naam ya mobile
se koi bhi bill dhoondh sakte hain.

58
00:04:45,423 --> 00:04:46,504
Bill mil gaya.

59
00:04:46,544 --> 00:04:48,425
Return par click kijiye.

60
00:04:48,465 --> 00:04:50,667
Bill ki har line dikhti hai,

61
00:04:50,707 --> 00:04:57,152
aur har line par utni hi maatra waapas ho sakti
hai jitni biki thi, usi batch ki.

62
00:04:57,918 --> 00:05:03,145
Waapas aayi maatra daaliye, aur kaaran likhiye,
jaise doctor ne dava badal di.

63
00:05:03,185 --> 00:05:10,439
Condition mein Sealed chunein to dava waapas
stock mein jaati hai; Damaged chunein to stock
mein nahi judti.

64
00:05:11,215 --> 00:05:17,848
Refund kaise hoga, yeh chuniye: cash, UPI, ya
customer ke account mein credit.

65
00:05:17,888 --> 00:05:21,868
Refund ki rakam GST samet apne-aap nikalti hai.

66
00:05:22,631 --> 00:05:28,172
'Issue credit note' dabaate hi credit note banta
hai: stock waapas, refund darj,

67
00:05:28,212 --> 00:05:31,381
aur day-end mein Returns ke neeche dikhta hai.

68
00:05:31,421 --> 00:05:36,474
Bill kabhi edit ya delete nahi hota, isliye
poora itihaas saaf rehta hai.

69
00:05:37,240 --> 00:05:41,581
Day-end summary mein aaj ke bills, cash, UPI,
card, returns

70
00:05:41,621 --> 00:05:45,888
aur drawer mein kitna cash hona chahiye, sab ek
jagah hai.

71
00:05:45,928 --> 00:05:48,933
'Print day-end' se ise chhaap sakte hain.
